      "content": "That makes sense from a business standpoint. But aren't there some arguments that this kind of \"efficiency\" is actually just a way to strip power away from workers and hollow out the middle class? Like, isn't there a bigger ethical issue with just prioritizing margins over people's livelihoods?",
